  "body": "Permanent. Limit 1 per deck. Purchase only at deck creation.\nBefore drawing your opening hand, search your deck for your signature card and add it to your hand. Then shuffle your deck and draw 4 cards as your opening hand.\nYou may not mulligan cards in your opening hand. Weaknesses drawn this way must remain in your hand.",
